# NAV-UPSELL - the Pro upgrade sheet hit from inside a sheet screen (New Task's
# Pro-only reminder chip), then the sheet screen closed: the app must still
# respond. Needs a FREE (non-Pro) account; skipped otherwise.
# Labels not yet validated against a free account (Priority 4 does that).
require-free-account
launch
sleep 5
tapif Cerrar/Close
tab 3
sleep 1
tap Nueva tarea/New task
tapif No es para una clase concreta/Not for a specific class
sleep 2.5
tap 1 día antes/1 day before
sleep 2
shot upsell-after-wall
pulldown 0.12 0.95
sleep 2
tab 5
sleep 1.5
scroll 0.7 0.5
sleep 1
cycle after-upsell|2|Configuración/Settings;Carga académica/Workload|1.5
expect after-upsell row_not_found=0
expect after-upsell no_back_button=0
